{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d4d427c5-38df-5cd1-931b-d0ad6a4fd6c0", "source_ordinal": 18, "reading_ordinal": 4043, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "瞎义警", "published_at": "2026-07-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2021674630205687158/answer/2058803543214141590"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "孩子看到别的小朋友闯红灯或者是做一些危险的动作等类似的都会去制止，但是有时候他制止的对象比他要大，甚至是成年人。如果我们家长不在身边，他也这样做的话，是否会给他带来一些安全隐患呢？感觉他做的是对的，但是他的这种行为是不是不够保护自己呢？毕竟这个社会不是非黑即白", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "教孩子是非之前，首先要讲清楚——", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "heading", "index": 3, "text": "世界上最大的是非，是权柄。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "heading", "index": 4, "text": "你先有权柄，是非才在你的手上。你有什么权柄，你才有什么样的是非。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "别人没有权柄，就没有资格告诉你做什么工作是对的，怎么做才是对的。你没有权柄，你也就同样没有资格去干预别人。", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "heading", "index": 6, "text": "是非不是客观题，而永远是主观题。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "卷子在谁手里，题就由谁答，由该判卷的老师来判，分由该人自己拿。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不在这个链路中，你就永远只能说“我觉得”“我个人认为”“我建议”“我希望”。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你没资格讲“你不准”“你不能”“你不要”。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为你也不能容别人来这样对你。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没有审判权的人，意识不到自己没有审判权，自认为随时随地有权“执法”，这是世界上最容易触发激烈冲突的蠢行。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "别拿“见义勇为”来扯淡，因为见义勇为是有严格法律规定、在特定条件下授予有限豁免权，它本身就是典型的有法可依才获授权的案例。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不属于这些特殊情况，根据自己私人对社会秩序的认知、在并无人身侵害险情、自身也没有合法授权的前提下去“执法”，这根本不叫见义勇为，也不叫讲原则，也不叫维持秩序，这就是僭越和侵权。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你可以劝阻，可以提醒，可以口头表达反对，可以举报，可以报警。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但你不能直接伸手阻止。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为社会不能这么运转。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一千个人有一千种规则理解，不依各自的权柄让各人在个人的权利范围内自行其是，而是放任所有人都可以根据自己的理解去干预所有人，这样的社会从数学上就是死路一条。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“自认为有理”加“很多人都觉得我对”就可以换到“维护秩序”这种执法权？这就是挨打挨得不够多。", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 759}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这种认知害了无数直接出声去阻止人插队、抽烟、电影院说话的人，白白卷入无数冲突。", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这些场景你都只能劝阻，劝阻不成只能告知有管理权和管理责任的人去干预，ta们不干预你只能向上投诉。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你不能直接撸起袖子去“执法”。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 864}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "打起来了你还是算互殴，而且是严格意义上的互殴——因为你并没有执法权、也不是法定意义的可豁免的紧急情况，你不是“见义勇为/维护秩序惨遭报复”，你客观上仍然算是寻衅滋事引起互殴。", "char_start": 865, "char_end": 952}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这些事，店员去管、警察去管，对方反抗了就是违约、违法、犯罪。", "char_start": 953, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你去管，你一起步先背一个“主动挑衅”。", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "越权，你就已经犯了最根本，最首要的是非。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "分清此情此景下你有多大的说话余地，然后再谈你的判断、你的看法。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这孩子根本不叫守规矩讲原则，而是学会了最糟糕的社会性传染病——假借名义侵犯他人自由。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "ta应该得到的是严肃的讲解、严厉的批评，而不是什么夸奖和鼓励。", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1131}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "不教清楚这一点，孩子必然染上“高举义旗指手画脚”的恶习，被身边的每一个人厌弃，然后不但不知自我反省，还要认定是“世界邪恶、不追求正义”，要“幻灭”，要抑郁，要绝望。", "char_start": 1132, "char_end": 1214}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "不尊重人的权利，无论你有多伟大的理由，你都是恶棍。", "char_start": 1215, "char_end": 1240}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "别再胡教八教！", "char_start": 1241, "char_end": 1248}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 27, "heading": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子守规矩讲原则，为了维护秩序，甚至会开罪一些比他大的人，你会用什么办法引导他成为“更完善”的人吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“瞎义警”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“孩子看到别的小朋友闯红灯或者是做一些危险的动作等类似的都会去制止，但是有时候他制止的对象比他要大，甚至是成年人。如果我们家长不在身边，他也这样做的话，是否会给他带来一些安全隐患呢？感觉他做的是对的，但是他的这种行为是不是不够保护自己呢？毕竟这个社会不是非黑即白”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "孩子看到别的小朋友闯红灯或者是做一些危险的动作等类似的都会去制止，但是有时候他制止的对象比他要大，甚至是成年人。如果我们家长不在身边，他也这样做的话，是否会给他带来一些安全隐患呢？感觉他做的是对的，但是他的这种行为是不是不够保护自己呢？毕竟这个社会不是非黑即白", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 130, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a16da506-5c08-5099-816e-25262f8afb82", "source_ordinal": 14, "reading_ordinal": 4044, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小炮仗", "published_at": "2026-07-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/635440ee78ad11f1b9a452540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个告诉你“这个人不行”的“理智”，其实说白了是父母同学朋友七嘴八舌拼起来的一种共识。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一种“如果你不同意我们会觉得很严重”的无声的管制，不是你自己的亲身体验。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不要误会——这不代表ta们的看法是错的，毕竟你自己也是认同者之一。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但人会本能的想要挣脱“正确”的统治。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果只能做大家公认正确的事，这之后的二十年我每一天、每一刻在做什么，我现在就能想象到。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我就像拿到一段录像，奉命对着相机复制那些动作的人偶。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那是对的，但我感觉不到活着。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "现在这个人，作为一个“错误的选择”，显得如此的诱人。你就像密集谋划炸毁车站，宣告反叛的革命者一样跃跃欲试。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这背后那份自由的浪漫才是你如此魂牵梦绕的真正理由。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "至于说怎么办？", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "是的，你其实没有想错，你的确不能、也不该生活在绝对的主流共识之中，那样你的确会活得非常痛苦和残缺。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你确实必须要在某处持有异议，去领取你的自由。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但不应该第一步就从择偶、择业这样的重大课题开始。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你应该从小得多、后果可逆的多的地方开始，例如穿搭、言谈。到了你要做择业、择偶选择时，你应该已经在小得多的课题上早就学会了特立独行，饱尝过你的自由了。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你应该已经没有再用更大的特立独行来向谁证明你自己的自由的需要了。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 513}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "对这些重大决定，你已经可以单纯的诉诸理性了。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别拿这种人生大决定作为新手头一炮。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "就这样。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 559}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：理智上告诉自己这个人不行，可就是有小情绪一遍遍得想他怎么办?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“小炮仗”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个告诉你“这个人不行”的“理智”，其实说白了是父母同学朋友七嘴八舌拼起来的一种共识。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个告诉你“这个人不行”的“理智”，其实说白了是父母同学朋友七嘴八舌拼起来的一种共识。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "361ab29e-ae77-522b-9c3f-1daf2618bd25", "source_ordinal": 9, "reading_ordinal": 4045, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "只管赢", "published_at": "2026-07-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1921845110859105635/answer/2059407848682082591"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "别听某些妄人扯淡，只管大胆的拥抱“赢学”，你只需要注意两条红线就可以——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）基本材料要真实。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）乐观期待要受到客观规律支持而不是反对。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只要你的乐观期待是基于客观实际，受到客观规律支持的，你就不要无端的去倾向悲观，而要大胆的倾向乐观。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是的，最好的期待发生可能性只有10%，次好的20%，次次好的30%……次次次次次次好的概率有40%，但只要这个次次次次次次好的仍然是好的，你仍然可以大胆的期待。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "连最好的、次好的、次次好的、次次次次好的……直到只比现状好一分钱、只有3成可能会发生的次次次次次次次次次次次好的，一起“赢”起来。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "然后愚蠢的、狂妄的、屡教不改的、笑口常开的执着下去，坚持下去。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就赢了，咋啦？谁看这不顺眼，要么是主观意愿上对你没有好意，要么是客观人格上自己没发育好。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "前者让ta自己憋着去，气死都是自找的。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "后者你还要反过来劝劝ta——因为所谓的坚持，大体上不过就是这么个具体过程。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "是的，即使你可以做到完全不带任何期望、抱着必死的决心去为伟大的事业慷慨赴死，你也仍然需要必要的期望让你对这样做会有实际的效果这一点感到乐观。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就是人肉炸弹也需要“这一定会狠狠的教训美帝国主义”的乐观，你要告诉ta这个没可能，ta也不会上赶着去自毁，不是吗？", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人可以超脱对死亡的恐惧，但客观上做不到一丁点乐观期待都没有的坚持。这是违反人的生存原理的。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果把这视为不合理、不名誉的，就像一个人把吃饭睡觉定义为可耻行为。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这都不是反对你而已了，这属于反人类行为。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "同样的，哪怕是在批评敌人，也不要去批评敌人执着于乐观可能这一点本身，要批评只能批评对方的依据不符合事实、推导违背客观规律、不为实验所支持。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "有三两分把握就觉得足够乐观，这是人的宿命，只要这三两分把握不是幻想出来的，这就不叫愚蠢。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "没什么可笑的。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 754}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对ta们是如此，对你自己也是如此。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你不用笑ta，也不必受ta笑。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 788}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "ta要是不懂这一点，那么ta笑也没什么了——人已经傻了，还不容人点快乐，还让人活么？", "char_start": 789, "char_end": 831}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“赢学”大行其道，其底层逻辑是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“只管赢”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“别听某些妄人扯淡，只管大胆的拥抱“赢学”，你只需要注意两条红线就可以——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "别听某些妄人扯淡，只管大胆的拥抱“赢学”，你只需要注意两条红线就可以——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "893754bc-52c0-5b80-9a90-3c8ad28acc68", "source_ordinal": 10, "reading_ordinal": 4046, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "45度c", "published_at": "2026-07-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2041502222035445096/answer/2041898320721958673"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "毋庸讳言，现在各个社交平台的极化、阵营化现象已经相当严重。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "即使平台自己努力“保持中立”，一旦有什么比较看似无关的要素集合了立场接近的人群，都会由美妆美食萃取出媚女调性，由编程游戏富集出媚男调性。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而人群成分的失衡有会诱导出内容制作者的迎合。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "越迎合，人群越聚集，人群越聚集，越迎合。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 142}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个飞轮运转好几年，用户的立场比例就，强行扭转调性，势必会丧失大量用户，严重损害利润。", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在如此强的后果逼迫之下，平台也只能——甚至是只会——努力争取不极端到触及监管红线罢了。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "平台做的这些对冲动作，更像是往95度的热水里投入冰块，以把水温降到80-90度，控制住水温不要走向沸腾，但却很难要求它们投入大量冰块把水温降到40度。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为那样它们自己会有生存危机。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是社会规律、商业规律导致的自然挑战，依靠宏观干预，极尽各方的动机和能量只能做到这一步，这也是为什么人们几乎只能在一群90度的水池栖身。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "要多冲这个挑战，只能靠一些自愿担当桥梁的人，去几乎是立场调性对立的平台里以一个足够可接受的态度去努力抬起茧房的一角，尽力弥合可以弥合的矛盾。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不是去对面挑衅、骂战，而是在理解、体谅对方的痛苦基础上，说明、调解。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不是要“彻底消除对抗”——这是劝和者们的一个常见的错误。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "事实上对抗是人的天然权利，是不可以剥夺的。甚至不容人质疑。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“说和”绝不能是任何意义上的“禁止对抗”或者“污名化对抗行为”。如果是这样做，你还没开口，就已经是带着不正当的立场而来了。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "说和、调解的目的，只能是尽可能消除误解和误判。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你要动手，这个是你的神圣权利，但在动手之前，要确保不是因为误会和情绪上头的误判，不是出于某种过度宣传、扭曲转述而造成的幻像。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "人确实看到的是事实，或者听过了另一种解释，仍然认为有必要动用暴力和武力，这个决定要尊重。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是人最后的自我防御手段，不管它的对错，也不论你是否认同，强行剥夺人最后的自卫权，其实都是残酷无情的压迫。", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "只能在所有人都同意的前提下使用的武力反抗，本质上不就是被废除了吗？", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这就像必须让所有人都满意才能行使的“自由”一样，是没有意义的。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 870}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果不能接受这一点、不能体谅这一点，你确实没有资格、也做不到对这矛盾的调解和缓和。", "char_start": 871, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你所做的只是名为调解的压迫罢了。", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 929}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "只消误会，只作说明，尊重人的自主选择——哪怕是你希望避免的选择——满足于对方给了你一次说明的机会，这样的立场，才能实际有效的改善对立。", "char_start": 930, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "再说一遍——不要想着“消除对立”，因为这本身就是在侵犯人的对立权，你站在哪一方的立场尝试去【消除】另一方的对立，本质上都是在帮着前者剥夺后者。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1069}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "然后会因为这个客观的偏向失去你的资格，最后连改善对立这种你瞧不上的刺激效果都达不到。", "char_start": 1070, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "一定要回到“只求避免无谓的对立”“只求改善对立的不可逆性”的正确的立场上来。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1151}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "举点例子——张三觉得李四的某个表达是侮辱自己，你感觉张三可能不太清楚李四那个方言表达的实际意思，你就代为解释一下，避免张三是纯因为误解了方言而生气。", "char_start": 1152, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而你解释清楚了这个方言可能引起的谐音误会之后，张三仍然认定即使按这个修正的理解，李四仍然侮辱了自己，仍然决定要惩罚李四，这个时候就是张三的自由了。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1300}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你不赞同、你不希望看到，你也不能反对、不能破坏。", "char_start": 1301, "char_end": 1325}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这时候你的立场只能转变为建议谨慎采用后果不可逆的手段（以防你自己将来发现真的是误判），建议不要采用非法的手段（以防你不但要招来李四的反击，还要应付公权力的威胁）。", "char_start": 1326, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这个严格说不是出于李四的利益考虑，而是出于张三自己的安危。", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1437}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你是因为爱张三而对张三说话，这个有限、克制的立场就必须坚守。", "char_start": 1438, "char_end": 1468}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你若越过这个立场，最轻的说，你也是只想实现自己的zz主张，而不顾这样对张三基本权利（武力自卫权）的侵害，也就是在拿张三作为自己理想的祭品。", "char_start": 1469, "char_end": 1538}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这样你又如何能苛责张三觉得你实质上是在损人利己，是在拉偏架呢？", "char_start": 1539, "char_end": 1570}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "ta根本没说错啊。", "char_start": 1571, "char_end": 1580}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "要改善现有的对立，平台、极化抱团的用户群体，监管部门其实都已经各自尽了自己的努力了。能进一步影响现有平衡态的最大变数，就是那些希望改善这个情况而不惜顶着顶着误解和敌意，走上矛盾前线的人们。", "char_start": 1581, "char_end": 1675}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "而这部分有志之士如果不明白“不能用禁止和惩罚对立来消解对立”的道理，就无法真正起到正面作用。", "char_start": 1676, "char_end": 1722}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "我做这件事已经很多年了，这样的错误我犯了很多。", "char_start": 1723, "char_end": 1746}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "我就自信自己说的每一句话都是出于对对方的爱，而说了很多实际上是惩罚、禁止对抗的话。", "char_start": 1747, "char_end": 1788}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "这是不对的，也没有起到我期待的效果，没有最好的帮助到急需帮助的人。", "char_start": 1789, "char_end": 1822}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "自己觉得是否出自爱是一回事，方法客观对不对是另一回事。", "char_start": 1823, "char_end": 1850}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "爱最大的价值，其实是不断的对自己方法的反思。", "char_start": 1851, "char_end": 1873}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "这就是我反思了千万遍的结果。", "char_start": 1874, "char_end": 1888}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "希望对有同样志向、想要做出类似努力的人们有多帮助。", "char_start": 1889, "char_end": 1914}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "不要反对一切的冲突，自以为这是捍卫和平。要反对的仅仅是出于误会、基于谎言和幻觉的冲突。", "char_start": 1915, "char_end": 1958}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "诚实的，基于对现实的真实认知而发生的冲突，反而是通向和平的真正最短、综合代价最小的道路。", "char_start": 1959, "char_end": 2003}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "专注消除误解，让该发生的发生，相信实践本身的指导意义。", "char_start": 2004, "char_end": 2031}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "别担心，天道亲人，结果会好的。", "char_start": 2032, "char_end": 2047}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待「北师大与小红书联合发布调查报告，倡导社会构建更友好的青年婚恋环境」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048"], "summary": "围绕“45度c”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“毋庸讳言，现在各个社交平台的极化、阵营化现象已经相当严重。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "毋庸讳言，现在各个社交平台的极化、阵营化现象已经相当严重。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8db8f172-3520-5077-a078-2c9578ebaf39", "source_ordinal": 11, "reading_ordinal": 4047, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "一寸欢喜", "published_at": "2026-07-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2039110884006604997/answer/2041179100837058049"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你不支持，那就告诉他你不支持。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "顺便说一句——不要无前提的跟子女说“无论你做什么决定我都支持”这种话。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你说你不知道该不该换工作，那么在你换不换工作这个问题上，我想过了，各有各的好处，所以无论你做什么决定我都支持。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这可以。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但你说你不知道该不该打死张三——不，你已经把张三打死了，因为你知道“无论我做什么决定你都会支持”。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“对吗？”", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问你呢，对吗？亲爱的老妈？", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，说这句“支持你的所有决定”一定要有具体的议题前提、范围前提。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "绝不要讲“我将永远无条件的支持你的一切决定”这种话。这绝不是一种健康的人与人的关系构建。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "回头他说要吸毒，你支持吗？", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "对方相信你会积极的支持，不应该是来自这种明显不负责任的过度承诺，而应该是来自你在若干议题上确实作了支持的事实。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不支持，那就不支持，没必要勉强。你可以不支持，而且他要学会接受你的不支持。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "爱的第一要义是要接受人的自由。绝不能因为你爱我，你就自动失去拒绝甚至反对的自由。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "爱一样可以拒绝、可以反对，爱和不爱的差别不在于能不能拒绝和反对上，而在于爱不能以越礼非法的手段去反对。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "比如为了让你学不成音乐故意去贿赂音乐老师，比如为了让你结不成婚故意藏起你的户口本。", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一个人如果把对方爱的宣言视为“自动放弃不支持和反对的权利”，ta就是在试图借着对方的爱奴役对方。而一个人自称“爱你就是永远支持你的一切决定”，本质上就是在盗用爱的名义行贿买好。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别干这种事。养成“爱可以反对，爱首先就要接纳反对权”的正确意识甚至比这个变不变性的问题更关键。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为无论变不变性，爱的观念正确，总会有可以相处的人。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这个观念不正确，谁爱ta，ta爱谁，最后都是掐着脖子互骂背叛的结局——人怎么可能没有异见？怎么可能没有不支持和反对？不支持和反对就算背叛，这显而易见是一个奴隶的标准，互相不肯做奴隶就算背叛，这种安排怎么可能不破产。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "注定孤家寡人。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "“孤家寡人”的优先级远大于“变性”。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "第二，我不支持，并不代表你不能做这件事。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这只代表几个原则：", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 836}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "1）你不能用我支付的抚养费用来谋求这个目的。我给你的零花钱、生活费，是用来支付你的衣食住行的，这个我作为监护人、抚养人，有权力作出规定。所以你不能做“把早餐钱、作业本钱、补课钱省下来买激素做手术”这样的尝试。", "char_start": 837, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为这本质上是在“公款私用”，就像会计挪了公司的钱去打赏网红主播，这是违反信托契约的。如果我发现有这个问题存在，就不得不收回这些货币形式的支持，只能让你每天拎着包子去上学了。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 1029}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "2）你可以使用你自己的劳动所得在年满十八岁之后去追求你的个人个人理想。你的劳动所得完全是属于你的，只要不违法，没人有权利干预你的用法。", "char_start": 1030, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在这个区域，你不邀请我、许可我，我根本没有反对和嫌弃的权利。尽管到时候我很可能还是不支持，但我也赞同你可以无视我的不支持，自行其是。我不会为你这个无视感到失望、悲伤、愤怒——至少我会向这个方向努力，因为这是我的问题，我有这个义务不让我的情绪成为你自由的障碍。", "char_start": 1098, "char_end": 1227}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "所以，归根到底其实你并不是必须要我的支持。", "char_start": 1228, "char_end": 1249}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "事实上，如果你必须要我的支持才能勉强去做，那么我的建议是你不该做，因为那意味着你其实并不坚定，属于天气好就顺势而为、天气不好就按兵不动的投机行为。", "char_start": 1250, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "投机不是不可以，但投机一定要是可逆的操作，不可逆的操作不适合拿来投机，必须以“即使没人支持甚至全世界的人都反对，无论顺境逆境、成功失败，我都绝不动摇”的气概去做。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1405}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "否则天气一定会有不好的一天。", "char_start": 1406, "char_end": 1420}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "3）即使你是用自己的劳动所得来完成变性的努力；我也建议你先做一下实验——即以女性的身份参与诚实劳动尝试支撑女性身份下的健康生活，先把作为女性健康生活的路走通，再决定要不要这种生活。", "char_start": 1421, "char_end": 1511}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你现在对女性生活的憧憬是存在幻觉的，因为它的成本是由我支付的。你不能指望将来你变成女性之后还可以获得这份免费无忧的供养——尤其是我已经明确的表达了不支持。", "char_start": 1512, "char_end": 1589}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "咬咬牙攒点钱甚至借点钱先变个性并不是你这个决定里的关键挑战，以后以女性的身份劳动支持作为女性的生存才是。", "char_start": 1590, "char_end": 1642}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "做不到后者，就像在不会游泳的前提下翻过围栏跳进湖里，只愁围栏碍事。", "char_start": 1643, "char_end": 1676}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你这个实验要做逼真，不能自欺欺人——你别想着走花木兰路线，白天用男生模样去求职打工，晚上再貌美如花享受生活——因为那和你变形后的生活并不一致。约等于是在用泡温泉的体验来模拟横渡长江的挑战。", "char_start": 1677, "char_end": 1771}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "出于对自己负责的原则，你别在这种自测中给自己放水，那只会形成不切实际的幻像。", "char_start": 1772, "char_end": 1810}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这个就是我的“不支持”。", "char_start": 1811, "char_end": 1823}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "我的不支持不会抬高你本该有的自由的成本，它只是没给你额外的助力。但这就是可以长久、没有反目隐患的健康的爱应有的模样。", "char_start": 1824, "char_end": 1882}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你将来也要这样对人，也要寻找主动这样对你的人，这才是你幸福的关键，而不是是否变性。", "char_start": 1883, "char_end": 1924}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "而且尤其是你打算要走变性这条更困难的路，你更加需要学会适应健康的爱带来的挑战。", "char_start": 1925, "char_end": 1964}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "简单来说，如果你现在能意识到我虽然没有支持你，但却给了你关键的指引，实际上仍然给了你帮助，因此能满意的感谢，那么我对你将来可能实现变性之后仍然能得到幸福的信心会大为增强，实际上会软化我的不支持立场。", "char_start": 1965, "char_end": 2064}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "而如果你觉得我对你说了这些，只是“在找借口不给钱”，那么我会对你将来变性后处理比这困难得多的围攻和挑衅的能力大为悲观，这会进一步的强化我的忧虑和不支持立场。", "char_start": 2065, "char_end": 2143}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "当然，我能理解作为一个孩子，你可能一时难以消化这么艰巨而曲折的分析，所以我不会把你一时的情绪看作你最后的答案。", "char_start": 2144, "char_end": 2199}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你可以把这些话记下来，慢慢的体会和验证去。", "char_start": 2200, "char_end": 2221}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "坦率讲，我不太担心和在意你是否最后要变性，因为到最后你是自由的人，一旦你成年，我只能学着平和的接受你一切自由的决定。", "char_start": 2222, "char_end": 2280}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "我更在意你能不能理解和接受这段话本身。", "char_start": 2281, "char_end": 2300}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "但实话实说——能心平气和、实心实意的接受这段话，是一个人毕生能达到的最高成就之一。", "char_start": 2301, "char_end": 2342}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "这话虽然直接出自我口，其实易地而处，我也很难简单的接受，这仍然是很大的挑战。", "char_start": 2343, "char_end": 2381}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "所以我对你不急，你也不必对自己太急。", "char_start": 2382, "char_end": 2400}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "慢慢来。", "char_start": 2401, "char_end": 2405}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "将来你会知道的——何谓进一寸有一寸的欢喜。", "char_start": 2406, "char_end": 2427}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 53}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：作为一个母亲，青春期的儿子坚持要变性怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052"], "summary": "围绕“一寸欢喜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你不支持，那就告诉他你不支持。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你不支持，那就告诉他你不支持。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c5387c74-4eb0-58ff-a62c-82d469118f33", "source_ordinal": 12, "reading_ordinal": 4048, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "轻而圆", "published_at": "2026-07-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/36982220/answer/2041125371681183721"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "除了“不生锈”这一条之外，其他的要求都很低的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一个最普通的薄皮熟铁锅或者不锈钢炒锅都可以满足。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正的问题是你这一系列要求体现出你对“好炒锅”的关键指标不太了解。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“无毒”这个要求其实跟涂层几乎没关系。涂层——尤其是特氟龙——都是高度热稳定的化合物。连几百度的高温都无可奈何的东西，即使脱落，也不会被消化系统吸收，基本只会自然代谢排出。更何况机械摩擦导致的涂层脱落在视觉上非常明显。如果你是烧锅导致的涂层完全失效，应该已经自己知道不能强行继续使用了。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要说有毒，主要是制作锅的材质有问题，例如名为316不锈钢，实际上是别的标号的废弃回收料之类。又或者是不规范的镀锡铜锅甚至就是纯铜锅。但这类问题主要通过选用大牌基本自然解决。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不粘锅靠的主要就是斥水性涂层，如果你不要涂层，不粘锅就要靠烹饪技巧而不是锅。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "油烟少更是典型的营销话术，实际上油烟量跟锅根本无关。可以这么说，谁家宣扬它的锅油烟少，你应该首先淘汰，因为它根本就是在骗人。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不生锈这一条主要靠用不锈钢材质或者用钛金属。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "炒锅最重要的特性，其实是两条：", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "轻巧和浑圆。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "轻巧就是足够薄壁，轻如鸿毛。这样厨师在颠动炒制的时候不但可以节约大量体力。只要锅稍微厚一点，从一毫米加厚到两毫米，锅就重了一倍，对厨师——尤其是女厨——的腕力就有大得多的挑战。无论是翻炒还是刷洗都会辛苦很多。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "足够薄壁自然传热也快，对火力的损耗也小。一开火就秒升温，一加水就秒降温。这对厨师掌握火候非常重要。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而且足够薄壁之后锅的质感会变软，装了食材之后炒勺敲在上面就会是“叩叩叩”而不是“铮铮锵”。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "第二就是要浑圆，除非你真的只有电磁炉可用，否则最好不要买带平底设计的炒锅。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "首先锅铲的刃口其实就是照着锅底的弧线做的，如果锅底不圆，锅铲的用起来就会很难受，尤其是要分离粘底食材会非常低效。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "好的锅底和锅铲的匹配加上恰当的技法，厨师甚至可以直接用锅铲完美的清理锅底，如果是一直炒一个品种——例如一直炒甚至可以直接省掉洗锅刷锅步骤。", "char_start": 759, "char_end": 828}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "浑圆的炒锅在颠动食材的时候发力曲线非常顺滑，而且非常省油。", "char_start": 829, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "就以煎鱼为例，因为是圆底你稍微加一点油，锅底就会有1cm深的油。这个最低点恰好也是火力最集中的点。你放一条鱼下去，的确这个油只能浸润鱼身部分，炸不到鱼头和鱼尾。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 939}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但是你是圆锅，你可以轻松的调整锅的姿态，让油和火聚焦到鱼头、鱼尾以及你喜欢的任何部位。", "char_start": 940, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你是用的平底锅，要炸这条鱼就要用上多好几倍的油，而且即使多了这么多油也炸不均匀——鱼的身形毕竟不是方块形，鱼身侧面不是平的，根本贴合不了锅底。", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "更不提你要想在锅里把这条鱼翻过来难度会大很多。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1081}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而更糟糕的是，这些且电磁炉设计的平底炒锅为了对电磁加热有最好的响应，都会额外加厚锅底，导致这些锅额外变重，更失去炒锅最重要的灵活性。", "char_start": 1082, "char_end": 1148}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "考虑到这全部的属性，你最后会发现万法归一，炒锅最完美的形态就是一块薄熟铁皮打的浑圆锅体。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1193}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "又便宜、又好用、又耐操、又无毒。", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1210}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "几乎没有进一步改造的必要了。", "char_start": 1211, "char_end": 1225}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有满足以下要求的炒锅推荐吗：无涂层、无毒、不粘锅、不生锈、油烟少、不太贵？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“轻而圆”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“除了“不生锈”这一条之外，其他的要求都很低的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "除了“不生锈”这一条之外，其他的要求都很低的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "da325fde-b89e-50ce-9a2b-e846efc4955f", "source_ordinal": 13, "reading_ordinal": 4049, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "群英", "published_at": "2026-07-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1982007173811814443/answer/2041528985348297545"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "英雄气有两种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一种是勇于托起本不该自己承担的责任。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "路见不平，拔刀相助；萍水相逢，仗义执言。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这也是你在问题中感叹的这一种。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这种英雄要么是自身的安全感远超过救助所需要承担的风险和成本，要么就是已经有了必死的觉悟。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "前者往往出现在盛世，处处欣欣向荣，未来充满希望，人有强烈的乐观，自然更能承担风险。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "后者往往出现在末世。天下动荡，朝不保夕，家破人亡，死伤惨重。这时候总会有很多人其实已经厌倦了整天在恐惧下生活，能坚持自己的价值，哪怕拼得一死，为自己心爱的人甚至偶遇的无辜者冒险犯难、争取生的希望，不失为一种痛快的对抗这大恐怖的选择。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "若非这两种情况，人是很难持续积极的把额外的责任和风险接住的，会胆怯、会畏缩，实属人生在世的平常——即使不为了自己，人也要为了家人保重自己啊，岂能随便轻掷呢？", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 346}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以我一直在说见义勇为要量力而行，要谦卑，不要轻易傲慢。", "char_start": 347, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但这并不是这篇要说的东西。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为你忽略了英雄主义真正的主要表现形式——", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "真正的英雄主义，并不是完成原本不属于自己的责任，而是不逃避原本属于自己的责任。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "家人有难，自己该有救助责任的，真要一走了之，其实要找到谈何容易？然而人却没有逃走。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也许有挣扎、有抱怨、有逃避和消极，但终究是顶住了压力，承担了自己的职责。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这其实就是英雄了。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "每一个含辛茹苦抚养子女的父母、每一个尽忠职守的员工、每一个诚实努力的劳动者，甚至每一个面对饥寒困苦而没有选择作恶的普通人，已经都是英雄。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "真的，就是这样。", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "如果你年纪还小，你大概率觉得这些都是“自动”的，“自然完成”的，很容易把这解释为“只不过是害怕法律的惩处”。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "等你真的有一天自己承担这些了，你就会知道这其实是一种什么样的英雄主义。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "路见不平，拔刀相助，脑子一热心一横，做了也就做了。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "顺水推舟，成人之美，勿以善小而不为，行了也就行了。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 761}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "而这样肩上扛着人生责任的英雄主义，是日复一日，年复一年，一轮又一轮的战胜自己的逃避和软弱的结果。", "char_start": 762, "char_end": 810}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "每一个没有逃走的人——哪怕抱怨连天、做得勉强——都是英雄。", "char_start": 811, "char_end": 840}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我常常看向窗外、街头、身边那些匆匆忙忙、“斤斤计较”、“胆小怕事”的人们。", "char_start": 841, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "ta们真的是没有勇气、不够豪爽、没有献身精神吗？", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 903}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不，根本不是。", "char_start": 904, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "ta们中的大多数，都是豪爽的把自己献给了自己的家人、爱人、子女、朋友、同事，毫无保留，还要加增。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 960}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "ta们“胆小怕事”，是因为必须五点接孩子，七点做好饭，是因为一家子人在依靠着自己。", "char_start": 961, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "ta们“斤斤计较”，是因为父母们等着治疗，子女等着抚育、朋友等着救助。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1038}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "ta们哪里不豪爽？", "char_start": 1039, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "只是不能豪爽之外再豪爽罢了。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1063}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "这个世界并不缺英雄，它本身就是靠着英雄们撑住的。", "char_start": 1064, "char_end": 1088}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你所期待的那种“超级英雄”，是盛世和末世从两个方向再生发出来的罢了——事实上，ta们之所以挺身而出，也更多的是因为认为介入那个危难是自己不该逃避的责任，而不是想要争夺什么荣耀。ta们只是把自己的责任看得更广一些，对自己的承受力看得更大一些，本质上也是在做自己相信的分内事。", "char_start": 1089, "char_end": 1225}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "而即使是盛世与末世期间，这些默不作声分担着分内的社会重担而没有逃避的普通公民——你的父母，师长、同事、亲友们，那些看上去普普通通的路人们，仍然是英雄的主体。", "char_start": 1226, "char_end": 1304}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "ta们对这世界的托举，仍然大于前者的总和。", "char_start": 1305, "char_end": 1326}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "永远不要忘了这一点，否则你会过于容易的对世界失望乃至绝望。", "char_start": 1327, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这不应该，也不公平。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1367}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你要找英雄，连家门也不必出。", "char_start": 1368, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "正在厨房里为你忙碌的那个就是。", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1398}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "镜子里的那个就是。", "char_start": 1399, "char_end": 1408}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 40}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0576"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为啥感觉当今社会上的有英雄气、豪气的男人越来越少了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040"], "summary": "围绕“群英”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“英雄气有两种。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "英雄气有两种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
